[00:02.01]Composed by：Sarah Solly Solovay/Jesse Finkelstein/Willim/Ruben den Boer/Victor Pool
[00:07.84]It never goes how you wanted
[00:12.60]And I wanted you bad
[00:16.58]So in sync when we started
[00:21.19]Now I don't understand
[00:23.99]How we went from wrapped around each other through the summer under covers
[00:28.67]Then spent January sleeping back to back
[00:33.79]God knows I still want you like the moment that I met you
[00:37.58]But it takes the both of us to make it last
[00:42.00]When you hold me at a distance
[00:44.25]I can tell that something's missing
[00:46.44]Like I blinked and your heart disappeared
[00:50.71]Cause even when you're right beside me
[00:52.94]With your arms wrapped around me
[00:55.19]I still wish I still wish you were here
[00:59.36]Ahhhhh
